# Cloudflare Pages response headers.
#
# Minimal on purpose. This site is a static brochure: no forms, no cookies, no
# client JavaScript, no third-party embeds. A full CSP with per-page script
# hashes would be machinery guarding a surface that does not exist, and
# machinery that is not exercised is machinery that rots — so the CSP here
# carries `frame-ancestors` only, which is the one directive that protects
# something real (clickjacking a mailto CTA).
#
# If a <script> is ever introduced on any page, this file needs a real CSP with
# that script's hash, and check-no-forms.mjs is the gate that will notice the
# script and fail first.
#
# Verified by scripts/check-headers.mjs, which asserts this file reaches dist
# with all four directives intact.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
